Coreboot4All
Copyright (c) 2026 Coreboot4All Contributors

This project orchestrates builds of upstream coreboot (https://www.coreboot.org/),
SeaBIOS, and related open-source firmware utilities.

Proprietary binary blobs (Intel ME, Intel FSP, AMD PSP, AMD AGESA, vendor
VBIOS, or owner-extracted flash regions) are NOT distributed in this repository.
